stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Accepted
    Accepted --> CompilingContext
    CompilingContext --> CallingModel
    CallingModel --> AwaitingApproval: tool needs approval
    CallingModel --> ExecutingTool: tool allowed
    CallingModel --> Completed: final response
    AwaitingApproval --> ExecutingTool: approved
    AwaitingApproval --> CallingModel: denied result
    ExecutingTool --> CallingModel: paired result persisted
    CallingModel --> Retrying: bounded retryable failure
    Retrying --> CallingModel
    Accepted --> Cancelling: user cancellation
    CompilingContext --> Cancelling: user cancellation
    CallingModel --> Cancelling: user cancellation
    AwaitingApproval --> Cancelling: user cancellation
    ExecutingTool --> Cancelling: user cancellation
    ExecutingTool --> Reconciling: process lost or deadline exceeded
    Cancelling --> Cancelled: provider and processes settled
    Cancelling --> NeedsOperator: containment or side effect ambiguous
    Reconciling --> CallingModel: idempotent result recovered
    Reconciling --> NeedsOperator: side effect is ambiguous
    Retrying --> Failed: retry or budget exhausted
    CompilingContext --> Failed: invalid manifest
    CallingModel --> Failed: terminal provider error
    Completed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    NeedsOperator --> [*]
